{"seq":2,"slug":"curriculum-instructional-design","title":"课程设计与教学法","stage":"DONE","category":"education","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"课程设计与教学法-简介\">课程设计与教学法 简介</h1><p>课程设计与教学法是将教育理论转化为教学实践的核心桥梁。好的课程设计能够系统地组织学习内容和活动，而有效的教学方法则能够激发学习动机和促进深度理解。两者的结合是实现教育目标的关键。</p>\n<p>本知识库系统讲解课程设计理论、教学方法和评估设计的核心知识，面向教育产品设计者、培训师和课程开发人员。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>课程理论</strong>建立课程设计的理论基础，介绍主流课程设计模型、素养导向的课程设计方法和课程评价技术。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>教学方法</strong>深入探讨三种具有代表性的教学方法——直接教学、探究式学习和项目制学习，分析各方法的适用场景和实施策略。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>评估设计</strong>聚焦如何设计有效的学习评估方案，涵盖形成性评估、总结性评估和真实性评估三种核心评估类型的设计方法。</p>\n<p>建议读者从第1章的课程理论入手建立设计框架，再学习第2章的教学方法充实实践手段，最后通过第3章的评估设计完成教学闭环。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"curriculum-theory","title":"课程理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/curriculum-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"curriculum-design-models","title":"课程设计模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/curriculum-theory/curriculum-design-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"competency-based-curriculum","title":"能力本位课程开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/curriculum-theory/competency-based-curriculum"},{"seq":3,"slug":"curriculum-evaluation","title":"课程评价与质量保证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/curriculum-theory/curriculum-evaluation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"instructional-methods","title":"教学方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/instructional-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"direct-instruction","title":"直接教学法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/instructional-methods/direct-instruction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inquiry-based-learning","title":"探究式学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/instructional-methods/inquiry-based-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"project-based-learning","title":"项目式学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/instructional-methods/project-based-learning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"assessment-design","title":"评估设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/assessment-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"formative-assessment","title":"形成性评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/assessment-design/formative-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"summative-assessment","title":"终结性评价与标准化测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/assessment-design/summative-assessment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"authentic-assessment","title":"真实性评价与表现性评价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/curriculum-instructional-design/assessment-design/authentic-assessment"}]}]}